# The status panel's active base (StatusWin_draw_active with a base, see statuswin.c): the base's picture and name, for another
# faction's base its faction, headquarters or size, defences and unrest, and for the player's own (or one with a treaty or under
# spies, or with the view of everything) what it is building. A base is made on the square two to the east of the first unit's (host
# status_base), the panel is pointed at it and the base picked (sel_base 0x8c6b28, sel_veh 0x8c6b24 -1). The game already has four bases (0 to 3), so the new one is base 4, at 0x97d510 (+4 the
# faction, former faction, size and assimilation in a word, +8 nerve staple turns, +0x30 the state, +0x40 the minerals, +0x50 what
# it builds, +0x8c the facilities).
